  "slug": "leftover-fried-rice",
  "title": "Leftover Fried Rice",
  "description": "OK, maybe this recipe doesn't have the most glorious, eye-catching, drool-worthy name. Still, it's ABSOLUTELY DIVINE, and so simple to make!",
  "date": "2021-05-20T20:52:15.456Z",
  "author": "asustainablefuture0",
  "coverImage": "/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_0b8d0353b44a4ab0aaf638f33b02e21b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1000,h_563,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01/e92ca0_0b8d0353b44a4ab0aaf638f33b02e21b~mv2.jpg",
